# Stay Safe Online – Cyberbullying Prevention Checklist

- Do not respond to abusive messages; avoid engaging with bullies
- Block and report users who harass or threaten you
- Keep your social media accounts private
- Avoid sharing personal or sensitive information online
- Save evidence (screenshots) of bullying incidents
- Talk to a trusted friend, teacher, or family member
- Think before posting or commenting online
- Use strong passwords and secure your accounts

## UPI / Financial Safety
- Never share OTP, PIN, or bank details with anyone
- Do not accept unknown payment requests on UPI apps

## Report Cybercrime
- National Cyber Crime Portal: https://www.cybercrime.gov.in
- Helpline Number: 1930
